==Aftermath==
Shortly after the elections, the Social Democratic Party of Reformists (SDPR) merged with the [[Ljubiša Stanković|Socialist Party of Montenegro]] to form the [[Social Democratic Party of Montenegro|Social Democratic Party]] (SDP). The four SDPR MPs formed the newly-formed SDP parliamentary group.

